      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability: cleaner structure, a helper method to eliminate boilerplate, an `ALL_BITS_SET` constant, removal of unused imports/fields, and inline array literals.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version introduces an `assertToAsciiBytes` helper to eliminate repetitive encode-and-assert boilerplate, adds an `ALL_BITS_SET` constant to name the all-ones byte pattern, removes unused imports and helper methods, and uses inline byte array literals with aligned columns so the progression of bit-setting and expected ASCII strings can be read side-by-side."
